    "created_at": "2026-06-15T11:19:39Z",
    "updated_at": "2026-06-15T11:19:39Z",
    "body": "It is, `XMLHttpRequest`'s `send()` has this problem as well.\n\nPerhaps we should make the coercion fallback explicit and opt new APIs out of it. But also in this case I think there's only one shipping implementation so maybe we can still change the shape of the API?",
