    "created_at": "2026-07-09T17:57:15Z",
    "updated_at": "2026-07-09T17:57:15Z",
    "body": "Echoing linus' comment - it's proven far better for DX to avoid coercion and throw rather than accept multiple kinds of things and try to guess at the user's intent.",
