    "created_at": "2026-07-18T06:17:31Z",
    "updated_at": "2026-07-18T06:17:31Z",
    "body": "I think we should do the inverse although it will be a little bit more involved. Add `[LegacyCoercion]` to all places that perform coercion today. That will make it vastly more likely new APIs will never run into this issue.",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
